# ===========================================================================
#  Git ignore rules for the Object-in-Hand Gripper website repo.
#  The site only needs two folders to build:  website/  and  Progress/
#  Everything ignored below is either auto-generated or personal dissertation
#  working material that does NOT need to be published on the web.
# ===========================================================================

# --- Auto-generated / installed (never commit these) ---
node_modules/
website/node_modules/
website/dist/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Personal dissertation working files (kept private) ---
# The signed declaration contains your handwritten signature, so it is
# excluded by default. Delete a line below if you deliberately want to
# publish that file in this repo.
M00983641_Aman_DissertationDeclaration_signed.pdf
M00983641_Aman_DissertationDeclaration_signed.docx
M00983641_Aman_DissertationDeclaration.pdf
PDE4435_report_pickerbot.pdf
pickerbot_gripper.pod
LaTeX Dissertation/

# Note: Progress/ and website/ are intentionally NOT ignored — the site is
# built from them. Bibliography files (citations.bib, weblinks.bib) are small
# and harmless, so they are left in.
